### 전국 데이터 적재 시작 (비동기 — 즉시 202 반환)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/data/load-all
X-Admin-Key: local-dev-secret

###

### 진행 상황 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/data/load-progress
X-Admin-Key: local-dev-secret

###

### 실패한 행정동 재시도 (FAILED → PENDING)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/data/reset-failed
X-Admin-Key: local-dev-secret

###

### 특정 행정동 단건 적재
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/data/load
X-Admin-Key: local-dev-secret
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "admDongCode": "11680640"
}
